A is a leading behavioral health organization with 35 locations throughout California and 76 providers specializing in the assessment, diagnosis, and treatment of Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD), ADHD, and other mental health conditions. Our multidisciplinary team includes:\n\nPsychiatrists (MD)\nPsychiatric Mental Health Nurse Practitioners (PMHNP)\nFamily Nurse Practitioners (FNP)\nCertified Nurse Practitioners (CNP)\nLicensed Marriage and Family Therapists (LMFT)\nAssociate Clinical Social Workers (ACSW)\n\nThe locations nearest to your service area include:\n\nFremont – 44240 Fremont Blvd, Fremont, CA 94538\nWalnut Creek – 1372 N. Main Street, Suite 206-1, Walnut Creek, CA 94596\nFairfield – 622 Jackson Street, Suite 103, Fairfield, CA 94533\nSan Jose – 1040 Park Ave., Suite 200-A, San Jose, CA 95126\n\nOur services include:\n\nPsychiatric evaluations and medication management\nIndividual, family, and group therapy\nChild and adolescent behavioral health services (ages 3+)\nAutism, ADHD, depression, anxiety, and mood disorder assessment, diagnosis, and treatment\nComprehensive mental health care and diagnostic evaluations\nTMS and Spravato® (Esketamine) treatment\nPersonalized treatment planning and care coordination\nIn-person and telehealth behavioral health services\nCommunity resource linkage and support services\n\nWe would appreciate the opportunity to participate in the HSBA network and would be grateful if you could provide information regarding your contracting and credentialing process, as well as any requirements needed to begin participation.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration. We look forward to hearing from you.","user":"Paul David","date":"2026-10-06T07:24:25.342Z"}],"insurance":null,"deleted":false,"st":"contacted","sd":"2026-10-06","sa":"Paul David","sh":[{"s":"contacted","d":"2026-10-06","by":"Paul David"}]},{"i":1132,"grp":"lead","attachments":[],"notesLog":[],"insurance":null,"deleted":false,"st":"new","sd":"2026-10-13","sa":"Tobin P